<title>UK: Baltic Freight Index fell to 1,463.</title>
<headline>Baltic Freight Index fell to 1,463.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Baltic Freight Index for spot dry cargo shipping rates rose to 1,463 today from 1,465 on Feb 21, with the base being Jan 4 1985 equals 1,000. The BFI is based on the following sub-indices with rates in dollars per tonne.</p>
<p>  Route Index    Rate	Prev Index  Rate</p>
<p>   1    1541    13.988	  1543    14.006</p>
<p>   1a   1496 11331.000	  1499 11350.000</p>
<p>   2    1820    26.000	  1837    26.238</p>
<p>   2a   1840 15094.000	  1848 15156.000</p>
<p>   3    1682    15.519	  1667    15.375</p>
<p>   3a   1511 11925.000	  1512 11931.000</p>
